#. 【黒幕のつけ入る隙】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[let down their guard]"
msgstr ""

#. 結局、黒幕のつけ入る隙って、
#. なんだったの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So when was it that the mastermind let their guard\n"
"down...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は直接聞いた訳じゃないけど…
#. 黒幕は言ってたんでしょ？
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I wasn't there to hear it myself, but do you remember\n"
"what the mastermind said?"
msgstr ""

#. ここでの学園生活の様子は、
#. <CLT 3>電波ジャックによって全国に生中継<CLT>されてるって…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They said they had <CLT 3>hijacked the airwaves to broadcast\n"
"our school life to the outside world<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…言ってたけど…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, they definitely said that..."
msgstr ""

#. その話を聞いてどう思った？
#. 簡単には信じられなかったでしょう？
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And what did you think when you heard that? Pretty\n"
"hard to believe, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ…電波ジャックなんて、
#. リアリティーがなさ過ぎて…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...I mean, the idea of actually taking over the\n"
"airwaves seems so...unbelievable."
msgstr ""

#. リアリティーがないのは、
#. それが滅多に起こらない事だから…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You don't exactly read about something like that\n"
"happening very often, so it's hard to imagine."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、それだけ困難って事よ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In other words, that kind of thing is extremely\n"
"difficult to pull off."
msgstr ""

#. だけど黒幕は、それをやってのけた。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And yet somehow...the mastermind was able to do it."
msgstr ""

#. 裏を返せば、それだけ困難でも、
#. やらなければならない理由があったのよ。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But think of it another way—there must have been some\n"
"reason they *had* to do something that difficult."
msgstr ""

#. 理由…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A reason...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうしても、世間に見せ付けたかったって事よ。
#. 私達の殺し合いをね…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They had to show the world something, no matter the\n"
"cost—us killing each other."
msgstr ""

#. 見せ付ける…？
#. ボク達の殺し合いを…？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "They wanted to show the world...?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、私達を殺すだけじゃなくて、
#. <CLT 3>私達に殺し合いをさせる事<CLT>にこだわっていた…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind has been very adamant about not killing\n"
"us directly, but <CLT 3>forcing us to kill each other<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. あんな校則を作ったのだって、
#. その為だったはずよ。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And all their rules and regulations were designed to\n"
"encourage that."
msgstr ""

#. 確かにそうだね。あんな校則がなければ、
#. ボク達は殺し合いなんてしなかったはずだし…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that makes sense. If those stupid regulations\n"
"didn't exist, nobody would've killed anybody..."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、黒幕の目的は、私達に殺し合いをさせ、
#. それを世間に見せ付ける事だったのよ。
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So the mastermind's ultimate goal was to make us kill\n"
"each other, and show that off to the world."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…なんの為に…？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...why?"
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、証明する為…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "To prove a point, most likely."
msgstr ""

#. …証明？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Prove...a point?"
msgstr ""

#. 私達、希望ヶ峰学園の生徒達は、
#. 世間からなんて呼ばれているか知っているわね？
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The outside world has a name for the students of\n"
"Hope's Peak, right? A certain concept..."
msgstr ""

#. “希望”…だったよね？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're talking about \"hope,\" right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>と称される私達が<CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>に沈み、
#. 殺し合いをする…
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And for those of us who represent <CLT 3>hope<CLT> to kill each\n"
"other and sink into <CLT 3>despair<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. その姿を世間に見せ付ける事で、
#. <CLT 3>『絶望は希望よりも優れている』<CLT>と証明したかった。
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind wants the world to see that, to try and\n"
"prove that <CLT 3>despair<CLT> is better than <CLT 3>hope<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それが、超高校級の絶望である黒幕の目的…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's their goal, as the Ultimate Despair."
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cái gì?"

#. <CLT 4>絶望は希望よりも優れていると…証明する？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They want to prove that despair...is better than hope?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんな…バカバカしい理由で…？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But that...that's ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、バカバカしくて理不尽ね。
#. だけど…
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You're right. It *is* ridiculous, completely\n"
"irrational."
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級の絶望と呼ばれる連中なら、
#. いかにも考えそうな事…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's the kind of thing that nobody but those who call\n"
"themselves the Ultimate Despair would devise."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望だけを行動原理とする連中ならね…
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That group whose only purpose and motivation comes\n"
"from despair..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも！　そんな理由で、
#. みんなを苦しめるなんて…ッ！
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But—! Is that really their only reason for making\n"
"the rest of us suffer!?"
msgstr ""

#. 怒りたくなる気持ちはわかるわ。
#. だけどね…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I know how angry it must make you. And yet..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな理由があったからこそ、
#. 黒幕のつけ入る隙も生まれたのよ…
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...that same motivation is what led to the mastermind\n"
"revealing their weakness."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私達の殺し合いを世間に見せ付けるという目的が
#. あったからこそ…
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because their goal is to broadcast this killing game\n"
"to the world..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、自分で作った校則にも、
#. 必要以上にこだわっていたのよ。
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...the mastermind has had to be more particular than\n"
"is reasonable about their own regulations."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕がルール無視で事を進めていたら、
#. それは“殺し合い”じゃなく一方的な“虐殺”になる…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If the mastermind simply ignored their rules, this\n"
"wouldn't have been a \"game,\" but a one-sided slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. 少なくとも、<CLT 3>“これ”を見ている人達<CLT>にとっては、
#. そう映ってしまうはずよ。
msgctxt "0040 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"At least, that's how <CLT 3>those who are watching this<CLT>\n"
"would have seen it."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、黒幕は直接的には
#. ボク達を殺す事が出来なかった…？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that's why the mastermind couldn't kill any of us\n"
"themselves?"
msgstr ""

#. それが、私を直接殺さなかった理由よ…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That is precisely the reason."
msgstr ""

#. だって、いくらジャマな存在と言えど、
#. 私は校則違反を犯した訳じゃないから…
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No matter how much they may hate what I'm doing, I\n"
"haven't violated a single one of their regulations."
msgstr ""

#. 校則違反を犯した江ノ島さんの時のように、
#. 自ら、手を下す訳にはいかなかったのよ。
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Junko broke the rules, so she was punished. But in my\n"
"case, they couldn't lay a finger on me."
msgstr ""

#. だから、黒幕は学級裁判を利用する事で、
#. 表向きは校則に則った形で、私を殺そうとした…
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So instead, they tried to use the class trial,\n"
"following all their proper rules, to get me killed."
msgstr ""

#. 正解のない学級裁判を仕掛け、
#. 私を、その犯人に仕立て上げようとしたのよ。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They began a trial that didn't have a right answer,\n"
"then made me out to be the killer."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、それも失敗に終わった…
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But even that didn't work..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君のお陰でね…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Yes, thanks to you."
msgstr ""

#. そして、その失敗により、
#. 黒幕はさらなる隙を作る事になってしまった。
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And due to that failure, the mastermind took yet\n"
"another risk."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人ではない苗木君の処刑…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They attempted to kill you instead, who *also* was not\n"
"the killer."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、その事実を、
#. この生中継の最中にバラされたからこそ…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And when that fact was exposed on live TV to the\n"
"entire outside world..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんの提案を受けるしかなかったんだね？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...the mastermind had to accept your suggestion?"
msgstr ""

#. 絶望が希望よりも優れていると世間に証明するには、
#. 完璧な形で、私達を打ち負かす必要があった…
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"To prove to the world that despair is better than\n"
"hope, they have to defeat us in perfect form..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、ルール違反をしたと知られるのは、
#. 黒幕にとっては都合が悪かったのよ。
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It would only do the mastermind harm to have it shown\n"
"that they'd violated their own regulations."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんは、そんな思惑を逆手に取る事で、
#. 黒幕に勝負を受けさせたって事…？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But all of that was a hunch, right? And you were still\n"
"able to get the mastermind to accept your challenge..."
msgstr ""

#. その隙を作ったのはあなただけどね…
#. あなたが私を信じてくれたお陰で、道が開けたのよ…
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well, it's only thanks to you that we got that chance.\n"
"Because you believed in me, another path opened up."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ、黒幕の計画や思惑なんて…
#. よくそこまでわかったね…？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Still, I can't believe how much of the mastermind's\n"
"thoughts and plans you were able to figure out."
msgstr ""

#. ボクなんて…
#. 全然、気が付かなかったよ…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I didn't have the slightest clue..."
msgstr ""

#. …いいえ、確証のない単なる推理よ。
#. だから賭けだったけど…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In the end, though, I couldn't prove any of it. It was\n"
"just my reasoning. Essentially, I was making a bet."
msgstr ""

#. …良かったわ。
#. 図星だったみたいだから…
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But it looks like I got it right. This time, at least,\n"
"I won the bet."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、彼女は大きく１つ息を吐き出した。
#. まるで胸をなで下ろすかのように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She let out a quick sigh. I took it as a small sign of\n"
"relief.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 正直、久しぶりにドキドキしたわ…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I haven't been that nervous in a long\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

#. とても…そうは見えなかったけどね…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I totally couldn't tell you were nervous at all..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、モノクマに会いに行く前から、
#. 自信満々って感じだったし…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You seemed totally confident from the moment we\n"
"decided to go talk to him."
msgstr ""

#. 堂々とした態度での対話…
#. 交渉や説得の基本でしょ？
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well, presenting a strong demeanor is a fundamental\n"
"part of negotiation and persuasion, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

#. それに、私が不安そうにしてたら、
#. あなたがもっと不安になるだけじゃない…
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Plus, if I'd showed my uneasiness, that would have\n"
"just made you that much more uneasy."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…そうかもしれない…
#. 情けない事に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, you're probably right. How pathetic...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、喜んでばかりもいられないわね。
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Anyway, we can't relax just yet."
msgstr ""

#. 私達は、まだ戦うチャンスを得ただけ。
#. ここで勝たなければ…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All we've done is earn another chance to fight. We\n"
"have to win this time."
msgstr ""

#. すべてが無意味になってしまう…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Or everything we've gone through will have been for\n"
"nothing..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だよね…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの言う通りだ。
#. 黒幕に勝たない限り、ボク達は生き残れない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If we can't defeat the mastermind, it'll cost us our\n"
"lives...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>勝つしか…道はないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There is no option except to win!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、最後の捜査を始める前に、
#. 他のみんなにも説明しておく必要があるわね。
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But before we begin the final battle, we have to tell\n"
"the others what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、もう敵はハッキリしたんだし…
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "True, but now we know who our real enemy is."
msgstr ""

#. 後は、みんなで協力して、
#. 黒幕を追い詰めるだけだよ！
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All we have to do now is work together with everyone\n"
"to destroy the mastermind...!"
msgstr ""

#. みんなで協力…
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Work together with everyone..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…なるかしら…
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is that really possible?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. …とにかく、まずはみんなと合流するのが先ね。
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Anyway, right now we have to go find the others."
msgstr ""

#. 行きましょうか…
#. きっと、寄宿舎のどこかにいるはずだわ…
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They're probably in the dorms somewhere. Shall we go?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>なんだかよくわからないけど、
#. とにかく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I could hardly believe it, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>処刑されずに済んだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...somehow I ended up not getting executed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんとか無事に…死なずに済んだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still had my life, and we still had a chance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、本当にうまくいくなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Overall, things turned out way better than expected.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>また、霧切さんに…
#. 感謝しないといけない理由が出来たな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once again, I was in Kyoko's debt.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん、ありがとう…
#. 何から何まで、霧切さんのお陰だよ…
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Kyoko...thank you. Everything I have right now\n"
"is because of you."
msgstr ""

#. 喜ぶのはまだ早いわ。
#. 本当の勝負は、これからなんだから…
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't thank me just yet. The real battle is still\n"
"ahead of us."
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだよね…
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, true..."
msgstr ""

#. …とは言え、ほっとしたのは私も一緒よ。
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But still, I'm glad it worked out."
msgstr ""

#. 良かったわ。向こうが誘いに乗ってくれて…
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I wasn't sure if the enemy would accept my proposal."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ、黒幕はどうして、
#. 霧切さんの誘いに乗ったのかな…？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But honestly, why would the mastermind agree to\n"
"that?"
msgstr ""

#. あんな勝負を受けたところで、
#. 黒幕には、得なんてないはずなのに…
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, they don't stand to gain anything from a final\n"
"showdown, do they?"
msgstr ""

#. 受けざるを得なかったのよ…
msgctxt "0096 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They had no choice but to accept."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、それこそが、
#. 私の言った<CLT 1>【黒幕のつけ入る隙】<CLT>なんだから…
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's all because of that one moment that the\n"
"mastermind <CLT 1>[let down their guard]<CLT>, like I said."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、まずはみんなと合流するのが先ね。
msgctxt "0099 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Anyway, right now we have to go find the others."
msgstr ""

#. 行きましょう…
#. きっと、寄宿舎のどこかにいるはずよ…
msgctxt "0100 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They're probably in the dorms somewhere. Shall we go?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. こんな物でボク達を管理してるつもりか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. Do\n"
"they really think that's enough to control us?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…この向こうに黒幕がいるのか…？
#. その正体って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
